- English word list (assets/hyphenation/en-us.dic) — derived from the Moby Hyphenator II list by
  Grady Ward, public domain (Project Gutenberg eBook #3204). The hyphenation patterns
  (assets/hyphenation/en-us.pat) were trained from it and are released as CC0-1.0.
- Polish spelling dictionary (assets/proofing/pl.dic) — converted from the SJP.PL Polish
  dictionary for Hunspell, version 2026-09-01 (https://sjp.pl/sl/en/), by the SJP.PL
  contributors. The dictionary is offered under GPL 2, LGPL 2.1, MPL 1.1, Apache License 2.0
  or CC BY 4.0; WordCraft uses it under the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE-APACHE).
